# Steer a square (OpenFL)

`>Keys` is a mailbox: Target may `inject` the held-arrow snapshot, then `Keys::update` notifies Game. Arrows move the square; it stays inside the play area.

## Schema

```
>Keys = Bool/left Bool/right Bool/up Bool/down
Game = PlayArea Square $Keys
PlayArea = Rect
Rect = Int/x Int/y Int/width Int/height
Square = Int/x Int/y Int/size
```

## Construction

```
[:Game
  [:PlayArea [0 0 800 600]]
  [:Square 380 280 40]
  [:Keys false false false false]
]
```

## Methods

```
Keys::update = { [:Keys left right up down] }

Square::nudge = {
  Int/dx, Int/dy, Int/minX, Int/minY, Int/maxX, Int/maxY |
  nx = x + dx.
  ny = y + dy.
  [:Square
    (if ((nx < minX) or (nx > maxX)) { x } else { nx })
    (if ((ny < minY) or (ny > maxY)) { y } else { ny })
    size]
}

Game::update = {
  r = playArea.rect.
  rightN = if (keys.right) { 6 } else { 0 }.
  leftN = if (keys.left) { -6 } else { 0 }.
  downN = if (keys.down) { 6 } else { 0 }.
  upN = if (keys.up) { -6 } else { 0 }.
  moved = square.nudge((rightN + leftN), (downN + upN), r.x, r.y, ((r.x + r.width) - square.size), ((r.y + r.height) - square.size)).
  [:Game playArea moved keys]
}
```

## Target

```
%openfl

%init
var assemblage:Game;
var down:Map<Int, Bool> = new Map();

function init():Void {
    assemblage = GameAssemblage.factory();
    stage.addEventListener(KeyboardEvent.KEY_DOWN, function(e:KeyboardEvent) {
        down.set(e.keyCode, true);
    });
    stage.addEventListener(KeyboardEvent.KEY_UP, function(e:KeyboardEvent) {
        down.set(e.keyCode, false);
    });
}

function held(code:Int):Bool {
    return down.exists(code) && down.get(code);
}

%step
function step():Void {
    assemblage.keys.inject(held(Keyboard.LEFT), held(Keyboard.RIGHT), held(Keyboard.UP), held(Keyboard.DOWN));
    var r = assemblage.playArea.rect;
    var s = assemblage.square;
    wchntGraphics.clear();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0x2a2a2a);
    wchntGraphics.drawRect(r.x, r.y, r.width, r.height);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0xf2f2f2);
    wchntGraphics.drawRect(s.x, s.y, s.size, s.size);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
}
```
